    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>MyPromptArt privacy policy</h1>
    <p>MyPromptArt stores account details for registered users, secure session data for authentication, and limited request data used to protect the public copy endpoint from abuse.</p>
    <p>Reference images and prompt metadata are handled through private editorial tools. Public visitors do not upload files, generate prompts, or create library content.</p>
    <p>When Google AdSense is enabled, Google and its advertising partners may use cookies or similar technologies and process browser, device, usage, and ad-delivery information. Depending on your choices and our advertising settings, ads may be personalized or non-personalized.</p>
    <p>Where a consent message applies, you can use it to consent, decline, or manage available advertising choices. You can also review <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads">how Google uses information for advertising</a>, manage eligible settings in <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/">My Ad Center</a>, and read the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    <p>Advertising is excluded from private, noindex, error, and empty-result pages. These disclosures describe the intended integration and are not a substitute for configuring an appropriate consent-management platform or obtaining legal advice.</p>
</section>
